      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>Little is known of the payyetan Elyaqim aside that he was a rabbinic Jew. We know his name from his acrostic signature in this song. If you know anything more about him, please contact us or leave a comment.</tei:p>
